1
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:50,960
God of War Baili.

2
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:52,230
The Lord...

3
00:00:58,530 --> 00:00:59,400
What happened?

4
00:01:01,230 --> 00:01:02,830
The bone-scraping whip in the heavenly prison,

5
00:01:02,830 --> 00:01:04,200
the immortal-locking nails,

6
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,730
the Lord suffered them all.

7
00:01:05,860 --> 00:01:07,600
Previously, to save the God of War,

8
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,130
plus the battle with the immortal clan,

9
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:11,300
his spiritual power was almost exhausted.

10
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:14,360
His old wounds haven't healed, and new ones were added.

11
00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:15,400
I'm afraid

12
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:17,560
there is no cure.

13
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:19,860
I just gave the Lord some medicine.

14
00:01:19,860 --> 00:01:21,120
Whether he can survive

15
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:23,260
depends entirely on his own luck.

16
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:24,500
Cangyuan.

17
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:26,130
Don't scare me.

18
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:28,530
Wake up quickly, okay?

19
00:01:38,900 --> 00:01:39,700
My wife.

20
00:01:40,530 --> 00:01:41,759
You're back.

21
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,160
I knew

22
00:01:44,759 --> 00:01:46,220
you would definitely win.

23
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:46,560
Yes.

24
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:47,930
I'm back.

25
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:49,030
How are you?

26
00:01:49,930 --> 00:01:50,789
You're crying.

27
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:52,460
No.

28
00:01:52,759 --> 00:01:53,759
You're mistaken.

29
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:57,560
It's nothing.

30
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,200
I'm fine.

31
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,260
When I get better,

32
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:04,520
I'll take you to Qiyue Lake to catch fish.

33
00:02:10,060 --> 00:02:10,860
Cangyuan.

34
00:02:11,230 --> 00:02:12,030
Cangyuan.

35
00:02:12,530 --> 00:02:13,330
Wake up.

36
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,660
Lord God of War.

37
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,660
What happened?

38
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,160
Why did he faint again?

39
00:02:18,230 --> 00:02:19,560
Didn't you say he took the medicine?

40
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:21,000
The Lord is too heavily injured.

41
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,730
The immortal-locking nails hit seven major acupoints,

42
00:02:22,730 --> 00:02:25,700
and the immortal clan's penal qi has long penetrated his meridians and bones.

43
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:27,100
Plus the previous overdraft of spiritual power,

44
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:28,329
his old wounds recurred.

45
00:02:28,329 --> 00:02:29,230
My medicine

46
00:02:29,230 --> 00:02:31,100
can only sustain him for a short while.

47
00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:32,500
He won't last three days.

48
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:38,860
Impossible.

49
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,600
He clearly woke up and talked.

50
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:42,130
How could he not last three days?

51
00:02:42,130 --> 00:02:43,530
There must be another way.

52
00:02:43,530 --> 00:02:44,460
Think again.

53
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:45,660
Whatever immortal grass or spiritual medicine it is,

54
00:02:45,660 --> 00:02:47,200
if the demon realm doesn't have it, I'll go to the heavenly realm.

55
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,730
If the heavenly realm doesn't have it, I'll search the six realms.

56
00:02:48,730 --> 00:02:50,190
I will definitely find it.

57
00:02:53,900 --> 00:02:54,700
As for a way,

58
00:02:54,930 --> 00:02:56,590
it's not that there isn't one.

59
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,900
It's just as hard as ascending to heaven.

60
00:02:58,900 --> 00:03:00,030
In the three realms,

61
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:01,960
no one has ever obtained it.

62
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,060
What way?

63
00:03:03,300 --> 00:03:03,860
Tell me.

64
00:03:04,700 --> 00:03:07,000
An ancient book in the heavenly realm's scripture pavilion records

65
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,260
that on the peak of the Western Heaven's Lingshan,

66
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:09,860
grows an ancient Bodhi tree.

67
00:03:10,330 --> 00:03:11,860
It bears a fruit only once in ten thousand years,

68
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:13,330
called the Nirvana Bodhi Fruit.

69
00:03:13,330 --> 00:03:14,600
Legend has it that it can bring the dead back to life

70
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:15,930
and grow flesh on bones.

71
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,560
But Lingshan is the territory guarded by the High God Bodhi.

72
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,020
Not just anyone can enter.

73
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:22,630
The peak of Lingshan is guarded by ancient divine beasts.

74
00:03:22,630 --> 00:03:24,360
Few people can come down alive.

75
00:03:27,060 --> 00:03:27,860
I'll go.

76
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:28,860
Miss Baili.

77
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:30,230
It's too dangerous.

78
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:31,160
You just revived your divine pulse,

79
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:32,160
and your body hasn't stabilized yet.

80
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:33,560
A place like Lingshan...

81
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:36,100
Watch him.

82
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,860
Wait for my return.

83
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:50,060
I will definitely bring back the Nirvana Bodhi Fruit.

84
00:03:50,060 --> 00:03:50,720
Wait for me.

85
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:09,100
This is Lingshan Holy Land.

86
00:04:09,460 --> 00:04:11,060
Trespassers, retreat.

87
00:04:12,830 --> 00:04:13,630
I am Bai Li.

88
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,860
I seek an audience with High God Bodhi.

89
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:17,320
Please make an exception.

90
00:04:19,459 --> 00:04:21,230
The High God has been in seclusion for a thousand years.

91
00:04:21,230 --> 00:04:22,400
He sees no guests.

92
00:04:22,660 --> 00:04:24,260
Considering your hard-earned cultivation,

93
00:04:24,260 --> 00:04:25,460
retreat on your own,

94
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:27,300
and I will forgive your offense.

95
00:04:27,430 --> 00:04:29,100
My husband is critically injured.

96
00:04:29,100 --> 00:04:30,960
Only the Nirvana Bodhi Fruit can save him.

97
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:32,220
Today, no matter what,

98
00:04:32,260 --> 00:04:33,659
I must go up the mountain.

99
00:04:54,130 --> 00:04:55,430
With your broken body,

100
00:04:55,659 --> 00:04:57,730
you dare covet the Holy Bodhi Fruit?

101
00:04:58,230 --> 00:04:59,430
If you don't retreat,

102
00:04:59,460 --> 00:05:01,500
my claws will show no mercy.

103
00:05:05,960 --> 00:05:06,930
If I retreat,

104
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,730
he won't survive.
